harness/README.md:25:`autoreview` skill, and the tailnet + launchd daemon ship in core. **Rebuilding those
harness/README.md:33:2. **Per-seat budget caps.** Core has no per-agent cost or token budget of any kind.
harness/README.md:34:3. **The never-ship-unreviewed rule**, enforced structurally.
harness/README.md:42:- **Guard 1 — local output never ships unreviewed.** A job built by a `local`-tier seat
harness/README.md:44:  can't rescue it (two juniors are not a senior). A failing review can't rescue it.
harness/README.md:45:  Re-tiering a seat after the fact can't retroactively legitimize it — `reviewer_tier`
harness/README.md:66:because Guard 1 makes it *impossible* to ship its output unreviewed. Bump to
