harness/config/seats.toml:149:notes = "OpenAI sub. Shares auth with [seats.brain] — see CONCENTRATION RISK below."
harness/config/seats.toml:165:// GROK — builder + cross-family reviewer.
harness/config/seats.toml:192://     "it can review as much as it wants more or less, but shouldn't build as much
