docs/ARCHITECTURE_v2_2026-07-14.md:63:  the secrets aren't in the repo, the env, or the agent user's reach (see §5).
docs/ARCHITECTURE_v2_2026-07-14.md:65:  database is on a filesystem the **agent user cannot write** (§4). The triggers are the
docs/ARCHITECTURE_v2_2026-07-14.md:68:  worktree** (its own copy). Trashing it costs nothing; `main` and every other agent's
